{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120945","id":3991590828,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7t6tes","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120945","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120945.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120945.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120945","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120945/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120945/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120945/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0753f9cc4f4e93c2429f80651e3763d075ae475e","number":120945,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add script editor type hints for `preload()`","user":{"login":"fragskye","id":199886693,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-oHZQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199886693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye","html_url":"https://github.com/fragskye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fragskye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15128\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds static types to the code generated when ctrl-dropping a resource from the file system into the script editor when `text_editor/completion/add_type_hints` is enabled in editor settings, expanding coverage for the existing feature.\r\n\r\nThis is a small change that I thought would be a good first-time contribution as the missing types were a minor annoyance I ran into frequently. The code is heavily based on the implementation for the `@onready` version of this feature, where it's used for Scene tree nodes. Tested with files imported as built-in types, scene files, script files, and `.tres`/`.res` files which hold custom classes inheriting from `Resource`.\r\n\r\nSide note: While working on this, I discovered alt-dropping nodes and resources (shorthand for an `@export`, implemented just after the `@onready` code) actually ignores the editor setting and always includes static typing. Was this an oversight?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","numbe